 <h1><span>Topic and Prompt of the month!</span></h1> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><span style="font-size:150%;"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Open&nbsp;FAQ</a></span></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><span style="font-size:150%;"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;FAQ</a></span></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><br /></p> <div style="text-align: left;"> <h3><span>what's this?</span></h3> <p>Underread and Underrated is a project intended to shine a spotlight on, well, underread and underrated pages!</p> <h3><span>oh neat. What's the blurb for?</span></h3> <p>As part of the associated UaU initiative, each month we'll be picking an element of SCP lore that people outside the general gestalt might not know about. We're also hosting writing challenges involving said lore!</p> <h3><span>may i suggest [blank] for the topic?</span></h3> <p>Sure! Do note, however, that anything with a dedicated hub<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-145247-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup> above +100 in rating can't be made topic. Sorry! D:</p> <p>Suggestions should be PM'd to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1613974&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608281518" alt="UraniumEmpire" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1613974)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" >UraniumEmpire</a></span>!</p> <h3><span>oh cool how do i participate?</span></h3> <p>Just PM <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1613974&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608281518" alt="UraniumEmpire" s